// AeroOps Center current-state DBML
// Last updated: 2026-06-09
// Scope: mirrors the Prisma schema currently implemented in this repo.
// Important: Flight remains the table read by some current UI/API paths.
// FlightLeg is now implemented as an additive future operational anchor bridged
// by FlightLeg.legacyFlightId. Release-evidence foundation tables now attach to
// FlightLeg. Airworthiness foundation tables now attach to Aircraft and
// optionally FlightLeg. Release-policy foundation tables exist for future
// blocking, override, snapshot, and audit workflows, but current release actions
// remain warning-only. Import staging foundation tables exist for future
// dry-run legacy imports, but no importer execution or operational writes exist.
// Crew scheduling foundation tables now exist beside CrewSchedule for future
// schedule periods, requests, rotation templates, and schedule entries.

Project AeroOps_Current_State {
  database_type: "PostgreSQL"
  Note: "Current implemented schema. Use this for build/review work that must match the live Prisma models."
}

